<title>BELGIUM: EU asks Russia to avoid WTO-incompatible measures.</title>
<headline>EU asks Russia to avoid WTO-incompatible measures.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission urged Russia on Thursday to commit itself not to introduce any new measures that were incompatible with World Trade Organisation (WTO) standards, a European Commission official said.</p>
</text>
